<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Clan History</h1>
<p><i>The story of the clans, kept as it was written.</i>
</p><p>On the 3rd Day of the Month of the Ancient Darkness, Year 270. The inhabitants of Valhalla realized they had been abandoned by the gods. The strongest formed groups to protect each other and to set out to make a better life for their members. These groups built homes and hired guards to protect themselves. Now many years later they have a safe home, a place to store equipment, their own clan bank, and even a messaging system.
</p><p>The clans over the years have grown by the input of the members and will grow even more as the years pass if members contribute ideas. It is even written in the histories of clans that a few clans have begun to talk war with others. While there is no way these rumors could be true it is very possible in the future that clan wars could erupt.
</p><p><br />
